ed_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","review_id":"ZUrHJV2tIbmawQWtRfrsew","date":"2016-03-11T15:04:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9454768896102905,"text_excerpt":"I am definitely a fan. It took me the longest to get to Red's, but once I went we were back twice in one week. I seriously have never tasted Chinese food like this in my life. It's not your typical dishes you would find at your standard Chinese restaurant, but honestly far better. I don't think you can even compare it to other places.The menu changes on a daily basis from what I've been told, but they still have a few staples that are consistently on the menu. My favorites: -Craw Rangoons. GET THEM. They are delicious and come out very quickly. Filled with crawfish, cream cheese, and a couple other ingredients, they seriously are addictive. -General's Chicken. Ummmm yes. This chicken is p..."},{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","review_id":"pFOa6Pecz14DsEShh2FAyw","date":"2015-09-29T01:45:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9419771432876587,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I had dinner here Saturday night and loved it. We had the General Lee's Chicken, which was sticky, sweet, and crunchy, Kung Pao Pastrami which was savory and spicy and the Mu Shu Pork which was tender, juicy and perfect rolled up in light, yummy pancakes. It was all absolutely delicious! There was an off the menu app - Tuna Poke which was also crazy good. There were fried lotus flowers in the dish - those things are addictive! The portions are large so we had plenty of food to take home. We definitely over ordered but everything sounded so delicious that we couldn't decide. Not to worry though, we snacked on leftovers yesterday and I finished off the chicken for lunch today..."},{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","review_id":"IVePrzZh7wBhFm0PlbmHqw","date":"2017-01-03T21:10:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9381812810897827,"text_excerpt":"Red's is phenomenal. I've been here twice (about a year apart) and throughly enjoyed it both times. Absolutely the best Chinese food in New Orleans, hands down. An excellent place to go with a few friends so you can share some stuff and get a bit of everything - I especially love the fried rice and the eggplant, and the general tso's chicken is always a big hit. Make sure you know where you're going though! It's definitely a hole in the wall. The drinks are also yummy, so if you're dining in, don't pass 'em up!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","photo_id":"mCmqlgLhIzKM9n4ypJ6rDw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/mCmqlgLhIzKM9n4ypJ6rDw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.868590235710144},{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","photo_id":"5Hz-hpR4OlDYFkkscIJhpA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5Hz-hpR4OlDYFkkscIJhpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8403973579406738},{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","photo_id":"8U4lrqgYOH4CxfMYpucP_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8U4lrqgYOH4CxfMYpucP_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8192272186279297},{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","photo_id":"hhVJxddNG9UVNE3mti_25w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hhVJxddNG9UVNE3mti_25w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8098245859146118},{"business_id":"e-fXMT8R3j7BKMTh8xn8aw","photo_id":"0CiQtgZBBFmXo4mW6CYWWg","label":"food","image_url":"/p